{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":16594,\"date\":\"2026-07-30T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-30T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-chiude-iphone-upgrade-arriva-apple-upgrade-klarna\",\"title\":\"Apple chiude il programma iPhone Upgrade: arriva Apple Upgrade con Klarna\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple lancia negli Stati Uniti Apple Upgrade, un nuovo programma di leasing per iPhone, iPad, Mac e Apple Watch con Klarna. Sostituisce iPhone Upgrade Program e iPhone Payments.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/apple-upgrade-program-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-upgrade-program\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15727,\"date\":\"2026-06-24T12:24:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-24T10:24:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-pieghevole-perdita-valore-primo-anno-1300-dollari\",\"title\":\"iPhone pieghevole: possibile perdita di valore fino a 1.300 dollari nel primo anno\",\"excerpt\":\"Uno studio sul mercato dei foldable stima che un iPhone pieghevole da circa 2.000 dollari possa perdere fino a 1.292 dollari di valore entro 12 mesi, con una svalutazione superiore a quella dei modelli tradizionali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15224,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T12:30:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-30T10:37:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-colori-dummy-sonny-dickson\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro, i colori in anteprima con i dummy di Sonny Dickson\",\"excerpt\":\"Sonny Dickson ha condiviso immagini di dummy di iPhone 18 Pro nei quattro colori attesi: Light Blue, Black, Silver e Dark Cherry. Prime indicazioni sul look finale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-18-pro-color-dummies-768x435.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-color-dummies\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15200,\"date\":\"2026-05-28T18:35:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-28T12:38:11+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aggiorna-valori-trade-in-iphone-ipad-mac-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"Apple aggiorna i valori di trade-in per iPhone, iPad, Mac e Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple aggiorna le stime di trade-in negli Stati Uniti: aumenti per molti iPhone, iPad e Apple Watch, cambi misti per i Mac e tagli per diverse offerte Android.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/apple-trade-in-2024-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-trade-in-2024\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14936,\"date\":\"2026-05-16T12:00:31+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-16T09:52:36+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-17-pro-piu-veloce-ricarica-test-cnet\",\"title\":\"iPhone 17 Pro: il più veloce in ricarica secondo un test CNET\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel test di laboratorio CNET su 33 smartphone, l’iPhone 17 Pro è risultato il telefono con ricarica più rapida complessiva. In wired domina invece il Galaxy S26 Ultra.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPhone-17-Pro-USB-C-Port-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-17-Pro-USB-C-Port\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14711,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T10:30:10+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:36:54+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-spatial-iphone-rumor-display-olografico-samsung\",\"title\":\"Apple “Spatial iPhone” in arrivo? Rumor su display olografico Samsung\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker, Samsung starebbe sviluppando un display olografico per un presunto “Spatial iPhone”. Nessun dettaglio verificato, ma emergono codename e tecnologie chiave.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Could-Be-Working-on-Spatial-iPhone-With-Holographic-Display-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Could-Be-Working-on-Spatial-iPhone-With-Holographic-Display-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14673,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T17:33:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:37:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-display-ltpo-plus-samsung-lg\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: upgrade display LTPO+ da Samsung e LG\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo The Elec, Apple starebbe finalizzando le approvazioni dei pannelli OLED per iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max. LTPO+ dovrebbe arrivare da Samsung Display e LG Display.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPhone-18-Pro-with-a-smaller-centered-Dynamic-Island-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-with-a-smaller-centered-Dynamic-Island\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14098,\"date\":\"2026-04-02T13:26:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-02T11:26:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"finita-era-productred-apple-cosa-succede-con-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"Finita l’era (PRODUCT)RED di Apple: cosa succede con iPhone 18 Pro?\",\"excerpt\":\"L’ultimo prodotto Apple in (PRODUCT)RED non è più disponibile: l’iPhone 14 Silicone Case in quel colore risulta sold out. Resta da capire se Apple riproporrà (PRODUCT)RED con iPhone 18 Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/PRODUCT-RED-Products-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"PRODUCT-RED-Products\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14061,\"date\":\"2026-03-26T21:33:26+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-26T20:33:26+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-fold-potrebbe-arrivare-dopo-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"iPhone Fold potrebbe arrivare dopo iPhone 18 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, l’iPhone Fold non partirebbe con le stesse tempistiche di settembre di iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, senza una data precisa.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/iphone-fold-text-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-fold-text\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13953,\"date\":\"2026-03-20T15:40:19+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-20T14:55:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-fold-ritorno-plus-dettagli-rilascio\",\"title\":\"iPhone Fold e possibile ritorno del Plus, emergono nuovi dettagli sui tempi di rilascio\",\"excerpt\":\"Un analista anticipa il lancio dell’iPhone Fold entro fine 2026 e un possibile iPhone 18 Plus nel 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/iphone-fold-pieghevole-senza-cornici.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone fold pieghevole senza cornici jpg\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13398,\"date\":\"2026-02-23T00:00:40+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-28T12:10:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-test-color-iphone-18-pro-foldable\",\"title\":\"Apple sta testando i colori per iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone pieghevole\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta considerando un nuovo colore rosso profondo per iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, secondo Mark Gurman di Bloomberg.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/iPhone-18-Pro-Deep-Red-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone Pro Deep Red Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":24,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12979,\"date\":\"2026-02-04T20:05:53+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-09T20:06:15+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-vende-iphone-16-refurbished\",\"title\":\"Apple Inizia a Vendere i Modelli Refurbished di iPhone 16 e iPhone 16 Pro a Prezzi Ridotti\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha avviato la vendita di modelli refurbished di iPhone 16 e iPhone 16 Pro nel suo negozio online, con sconti dal 12% al 22% rispetto ai prezzi precedenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/iphone-16-pro-colors-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone pro colors\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":36,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12945,\"date\":\"2026-02-03T09:57:40+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-09T19:57:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-aggiornamenti-macos-watchos\",\"title\":\"Apple Rilascia Aggiornamenti per macOS 11, watchOS 10 e watchOS 9 per Mantenere iMessage e FaceTime Funzionanti su Dispositivi Più Vecchi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato macOS 11.7.11, watchOS 10.6.2 e watchOS 9.6.4 per dispositivi più vecchi, garantendo il funzionamento di iMessage e FaceTime fino a gennaio 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/apple-watch-se-red-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple watch se red\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":27,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12585,\"date\":\"2026-01-20T11:25:38+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-01-20T10:25:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-face-id-ltpo-plus-dynamic-island\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Face ID Sotto Schermo, Display LTPO+ e il Dibattito sul Dynamic Island Continua\",\"excerpt\":\"Mentre la maggior parte delle fonti concordano sul fatto che i modelli iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max presenteranno il Face ID sotto schermo, continuano a circolare voci contrastanti su come questo cambiamento potrebbe influenzare il Dynamic Island.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/01/iPhone-Top-Left-Hole-Punch-Face-ID-Feature-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone Top Left Hole Punch Face ID Feature Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":54,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":11031,\"date\":\"2025-11-10T15:57:45+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-10T14:57:45+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-aggiorna-valori-ritiro-iphone-ipad-mac\",\"title\":\"Apple Aggiorna i Valori di Ritiro per iPhone, iPad, Mac e Altro\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha aggiornato i valori di ritiro per alcuni modelli di iPhone, iPad, Mac e Apple Watch. I ritiro possono essere effettuati sul sito web di Apple o presso un Apple Store.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/2024-iPhone-Boxes-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone Boxes Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":88,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":11011,\"date\":\"2025-11-10T15:56:47+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-10T14:56:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-air-2026-due-fotocamere\",\"title\":\"L'iPhone Air 2026 potrebbe presentare due fotocamere posteriori, secondo un leaker\",\"excerpt\":\"Il prossimo iPhone Air di Apple potrebbe avere due fotocamere posteriori, secondo un leaker cinese con fonti nella catena di approvvigionamento di Apple.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/iphone-air-camera-768x449.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone air camera\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":78,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":10938,\"date\":\"2025-11-05T18:26:17+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-11-05T17:26:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-nuovo-colore\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Si Rumoreggia l'Arrivo di un Solo Nuovo Colore\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta testando tre nuove opzioni di colore per i modelli iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max, ma prevede di procedere con solo uno di questi finish.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/11/Coffee-Burgundy-and-Purple-iPhone-18-Pro-Mock-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Coffee Burgundy and Purple iPhone Pro Mock\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":104,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":10605,\"date\":\"2025-10-25T12:47:33+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-10-25T10:47:33+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-air-fallimento-produzione-ridotta\",\"title\":\"Il fallimento dell'esperimento iPhone Air di Apple: produzione ridotta dell'80%\",\"excerpt\":\"La domanda per l'iPhone Air non ha soddisfatto le aspettative di Apple, portando a una riduzione della produzione e delle spedizioni.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\